	* The name and amount of each security held in the account;
	* The number of shares or units of each security purchased and sold, the unit or share price at which purchased and sold, and the trade date of each purchase and sale;
	* The total amount of funds received from or paid on behalf of the customer;
	* The total amount of income received or accrued on behalf of the customer;
